// The Byzantine Keep's recorded sounds, each an MP3, mixed to mono and levelled, decoded once when keep-audio.js
// opens its context:
// - `choir`, the choir the ghost hunt plays as an elixir is taken (ghost-audio-data.js `choir`, the YouTube video
//   m9IQ6Y6_a4o, "Choir Sound Effect", Sound Effect Database), copied here so the Keep's deferred group carries it
//   without the hunt's, which is temporary (HALLOWEEN). Heard when the two knights first come face to face.
// - `bridge`, the drawbridge's chains and timbers (the YouTube video nSAG6F4oHG8, "Castle Draw Bridge Open", HQSFX,
//   from 0.4 s on, 14.7 s), heard while the drawbridge comes down and the portcullis goes up.
// - `wake`, the water along the boat's hull (the YouTube video B3oD4rhWsSY, "Floating Water – Calm Water Sounds",
//   Sounds of Peace, its first five seconds, its end crossfaded into its start so it loops), as loud as the boat goes.
// - `cannonShot` and `cannonHit`, a turret's cannon firing and its ball bursting on something (the YouTube video
//   4afB4wcRH-A, "FREE EXPLOSION SOUND FX (Royalty Free!)", FREE SOUND LIBRARY: 1:25.2 to 1:27 and 0:52.3 to 0:54,
//   each from where its sound starts in the stretch asked for, faded out at its end).
// - `sword1` to `sword3`, a sword swung, the visitor's own strikes taking them in turn (the YouTube short DaiIp5tGmFE,
//   "Weapon Sword, whoosh, impact and deflect", Poptronic Sound Corner: its first three sounds, 0:00.15 to 0:01.9,
//   0:02.4 to 0:04.3 and 0:04.5 to 0:05.75, each faded out at its end).
// - `ogreDie`, the ogre's roar as it is brought down (the YouTube video _Rn_tpRAwaA, "Ogre sounds", The Reno Chimp:
//   0:16.62 to 0:20.1, the roar in the stretch 0:16 to 0:20 asked for, from where it starts, faded out at its end).
// - `ogreFall`, the ogre hitting the ground as it falls (the YouTube video 3UxbKgIBenM, "24 FREE Bone Cracking Sound
//   Effects", TotalSFX: 0:35.77 to 0:37.3, from where its sound starts in the stretch 0:35 to 0:37 asked for, faded).
// - `skeletonDie`, a skeleton coming apart as it is destroyed, white or green (the YouTube video mXpFi4hmXtg, "Bone &
//   Gore SFX // FREE SAMPLES [96kHz]", Aturax Audio: 1:36.31 to 1:37.6, from where its sound starts in the stretch 1:36
//   to 1:38 asked for, faded out at its end).
// - `slam`, the sword slammed into the ground at the end of its combo (the YouTube video AcoyryrzM5Y, "10 Best Slam
//   Impact - Sound Effect", Free Sounds Collection: 0:31.74 to 0:33, its impact on, the quiet lead-in before it
//   trimmed off, faded out at its end).
// - `cannonFire`, a cannon's roar of fire as it shoots, heard with `cannonShot` (the YouTube video J5ZIsW9IL8g,
//   "Fireball - Sound Effect HD (No Copyright Sound)", GSS FX: 0:01 to 0:03, faded in and out, levelled).
// - `questStart`, a magic chime heard as a new quest is accepted (the YouTube video O5Y1QGG0q90, "Magic Sound
//   Effects", 2MirrorsDialogue: 0:10.55 to 0:14, from where its sound starts in the stretch 0:10 to 0:14 asked for,
//   faded out at its end, levelled).
// - `questItem`, a magic sparkle heard as a quest's item is taken (the YouTube video O5Y1QGG0q90, "Magic Sound
//   Effects", 2MirrorsDialogue: 0:06.68 to 0:08.05, from where its sound starts in the stretch 0:06 to 0:08 asked
//   for, faded out at its end, levelled).
// - `spellHold`, the wand's fireball drawn in while its strike is held (the YouTube video 21cQpUOzn9U, "Cosmic Beam
//   [Sound Design]", Matthieu Rauber: 0:02 to 0:05, faded in and out, levelled), stopped as it is let go.
// - `spellCharge`, the wand's fourth step, raised to the sky and thrust (the YouTube video k_Ggr9U77vY, "10 Dark Magic
//   SOUND EFFECTS (NO Copyright)", The Audio Horizon SFX: 0:21.68 to 0:26, from where its sound starts in the stretch
//   0:22 to 0:26 asked for, faded out at its end, levelled).
// - `wandFire`, the wand's fireball let go (the YouTube video ghObc6JGY88, "Torch Whoosh Sound Effect", SM SOUNDFX:
//   0:02.63 to 0:04.3, from where its sound starts, faded out at its end, levelled).
// - `swordRaise`, the frost blade raised to the sky for its fourth step (the YouTube video klYSezXGHrM, "10 Ancient
//   Magic Spells Sound Effects (FREE)", The Audio Horizon SFX: 0:21 to 0:25, faded out over its last 0.4 s, levelled).
// - `swordBolt`, the lightning standing on the frost blade while it is raised, heard with `swordRaise` (the YouTube
//   video oZL3GPNt_MQ, "Electricity - Sound Effect (HD)", Boom Sounds: 0:00 to 0:03, faded out over its last 0.4 s,
//   levelled).
// - `staffPulse`, the staff's held strike let go, its pulse bursting out (the YouTube video zPZZ5bS2JLk, "Sound Effect
//   No Copyright (Boom, Downshifter, Impact, Transition, Drone, Riser, Whoosh, Glitch)", as production: 0:04 to 0:07,
//   faded out over its last 0.4 s, levelled).
// - `staffRune`, the level 4 staff's fourth step, raised to the sky and its rune circle laid on the ground (the YouTube
//   video k_Ggr9U77vY, "10 Dark Magic SOUND EFFECTS (NO Copyright)", The Audio Horizon SFX: 1:09 to 1:15, faded out
//   quickly over its last 0.45 s, levelled).
// - `lightningHit`, a bolt from the sky striking an enemy at the frost blade's fourth step (the YouTube video
//   EQt2qtosrEg, "FREE SOUND FX Thunder Single Lightning Bolt", GAMING SOUND EFFECTS: 0:00 to 0:03, faded out over its
//   last 0.4 s, levelled).
// - `wandRain`, the wand's held cast past its draw-in, fire raining from the sky round the Ooga (the YouTube video
//   k_Ggr9U77vY, "10 Dark Magic SOUND EFFECTS (NO Copyright)", The Audio Horizon SFX: 0:48 to 0:53, faded out over
//   its last 0.45 s, levelled).
// - `wandStart`, the wand's held cast as its rune comes down (the YouTube video ra9D6dOkJRY, "RPG Magic SFX [No AI] |
//   Japanese RPG Magic Sound Effects | Royalty free magic spell sound", WOW Sound: 0:13 to 0:15, faded out over its last
//   0.35 s, levelled).
(() => {
  "use strict";
  const BL = window.BL = window.BL || {};
  BL.keepAudioData = { wandStart: "", wandRain: "", staffPulse: "", staffRune: "", swordBolt: "", swordRaise: "", lightningHit: "", questItem: "", questStart: "", cannonFire: "", ogreDie: "", ogreFall: "", skeletonDie: "", slam: "", sword1: "", sword2: "", sword3: "", cannonShot: "", cannonHit: "", bridge: "", wake: "", choir: "", spellHold: "", spellCharge: "", wandFire: "" };
})();
